{"seq":4,"slug":"image-loading","title":"图片加载","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/android-development/networking-and-data/image-loading","wordCount":564,"readingTime":3,"html":"<h1 id=\"图片加载\">图片加载</h1><p>图片加载是 Android 应用的常见需求。Coil（Coroutine Image Loader）是为 Kotlin 和 Compose 设计的现代图片加载库，以协程为核心，API 简洁，性能优秀。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>Coil 围绕四个核心概念：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Compose-first API</strong>：<code>AsyncImage</code> 是最常用的加载组件，<code>SubcomposeAsyncImage</code> 支持自定义加载/错误状态的 Composable，<code>rememberAsyncImagePainter</code> 返回 Painter 配合 <code>Image</code> 使用。</li>\n<li><strong>加载状态管理</strong>：<code>placeholder</code>（加载中）、<code>error</code>（失败）、<code>fallback</code>（data 为 null）以及 <code>crossfade</code> 淡入过渡，配合 <code>AsyncImagePainter.State</code> 精细控制。</li>\n<li><strong>两级缓存</strong>：内存缓存与磁盘缓存自动管理，通过 <code>ImageLoader</code> 统一配置容量，<code>CachePolicy</code> 逐请求控制读写行为。</li>\n<li><strong>图片变换</strong>：内置 <code>CircleCrop</code> / <code>RoundedCorners</code> / <code>Blur</code> / <code>Grayscale</code> 等变换，也可实现 <code>Transformation</code> 自定义处理。</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"coil-基础-compose-first\">Coil 基础（Compose-first）</h2><p>Coil 提供了原生的 Compose 支持，<code>AsyncImage</code> 是最常用的图片加载组件。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"@Composable&#10;fun UserAvatar(imageUrl: String, modifier: Modifier = Modifier) {&#10;    AsyncImage(&#10;        model = imageUrl,&#10;        contentDescription = &quot;用户头像&quot;,&#10;        modifier = modifier&#10;            .size(64.dp)&#10;            .clip(CircleShape),&#10;        contentScale = ContentScale.Crop&#10;    )&#10;}&#10;&#10;@Composable&#10;fun ArticleImage(imageUrl: String, modifier: Modifier = Modifier) {&#10;    AsyncImage(&#10;        model = ImageRequest.Builder(LocalContext.current)&#10;            .data(imageUrl)&#10;            .crossfade(true)&#10;            .build(),&#10;        contentDescription = &quot;文章封面&quot;,&#10;        modifier = modifier&#10;            .fillMaxWidth()&#10;            .height(200.dp)&#10;            .clip(RoundedCornerShape(8.dp)),&#10;        contentScale = ContentScale.Crop&#10;    )&#10;}&#10;&#10;@Composable&#10;fun ProductGallery(images: List&lt;String&gt;) {&#10;    LazyRow(&#10;        contentPadding = PaddingValues(horizontal = 16.dp),&#10;        horizontalArrangement = Arrangement.spacedBy(8.dp)&#10;    ) {&#10;        items(images) { url -&gt;&#10;            AsyncImage(&#10;                model = url,&#10;                contentDescription = null,&#10;                modifier = Modifier&#10;                    .size(120.dp)&#10;                    .clip(RoundedCornerShape(8.dp)),&#10;                contentScale = ContentScale.Crop&#10;            )&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>@Composable</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fun UserAvatar(imageUrl: String, modifier: Modifier = Modifier) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    AsyncImage(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        model = imageUrl,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        contentDescription = \"用户头像\",</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        modifier = modifier</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            .size(64.dp)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            .clip(CircleShape),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        contentScale = ContentScale.Crop</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>@Composable</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fun ArticleImage(imageUrl: String, modifier: Modifier = Modifier) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    AsyncImage(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        model = ImageRequest.Builder(LocalContext.current)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            .data(imageUrl)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            .crossfade(true)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            .build(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        contentDescription = \"文章封面\",</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        modifier = modifier</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            .fillMaxWidth()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            .height(200.dp)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            .clip(RoundedCornerShape(8.dp)),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        contentScale = ContentScale.Crop</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>@Composable</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fun ProductGallery(images: List&#x3C;String>) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    LazyRow(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        contentPadding = PaddingValues(horizontal = 16.dp),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        horizontalArrangement = Arrangement.spacedBy(8.dp)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    ) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        items(images) { url -></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            AsyncImage(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                model = url,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                contentDescription = null,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                modifier = Modifier</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                    .size(120.dp)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                    .clip(RoundedCornerShape(8.dp)),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                contentScale = ContentScale.Crop</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>Coil 在 Compose 中的组件对比：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>组件</th>\n<th>用途</th>\n<th>特点</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>AsyncImage</code></td>\n<td>最常用的图片加载</td>\n<td>简单直接</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>SubcomposeAsyncImage</code></td>\n<td>自定义加载/错误状态</td>\n<td>支持 Composable 占位</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>rememberAsyncImagePainter</code></td>\n<td>获取 Painter 对象</td>\n<td>配合 <code>Image</code> 使用</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"placeholder-error-crossfade\">Placeholder / Error / Crossfade</h2><p>完善的加载状态管理提升用户体验。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"@Composable&#10;fun RobustImage(imageUrl: String, modifier: Modifier = Modifier) {&#10;    SubcomposeAsyncImage(&#10;        model = ImageRequest.Builder(LocalContext.current)&#10;            .data(imageUrl)&#10;            .crossfade(300)&#10;            .build(),&#10;        contentDescription = null,&#10;        modifier = modifier&#10;    ) {&#10;        val state = painter.state&#10;        when (state) {&#10;            is AsyncImagePainter.State.Loading -&gt; {&#10;                Box(&#10;                    modifier = Modifier&#10;                        .fillMaxSize()&#10;                        .shimmerEffect(),&#10;                    contentAlignment = Alignment.Center&#10;                ) {&#10;                    CircularProgressIndicator(modifier = Modifier.size(24.dp))&#10;                }&#10;            }&#10;            is AsyncImagePainter.State.Error -&gt; {&#10;                Box(&#10;                    modifier = Modifier&#10;                        .fillMaxSize()&#10;                        .background(MaterialTheme.colorScheme.errorContainer),&#10;                    contentAlignment = Alignment.Center&#10;                ) {&#10;                    Icon(&#10;                        Icons.Default.BrokenImage,&#10;                        contentDescription = &quot;加载失败&quot;,&#10;                        tint = MaterialTheme.colorScheme.onErrorContainer&#10;                    )&#10;                }&#10;            }&#10;            else -&gt; {&#10;                SubcomposeAsyncImageContent()&#10;            }&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;}&#10;&#10;@Composable&#10;fun SimpleImageWithPlaceholder(imageUrl: String, modifier: Modifier = Modifier) {&#10;    AsyncImage(&#10;        model = ImageRequest.Builder(LocalContext.current)&#10;            .data(imageUrl)&#10;            .crossfade(true)&#10;            .placeholder(R.drawable.placeholder)&#10;            .error(R.drawable.error_image)&#10;            .fallback(R.drawable.default_avatar)&#10;            .build(),&#10;        contentDescription = null,&#10;        modifier = modifier&#10;    )&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>@Composable</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fun RobustImage(imageUrl: String, modifier: Modifier = Modifier) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    SubcomposeAsyncImage(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        model = ImageRequest.Builder(LocalContext.current)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            .data(imageUrl)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            .crossfade(300)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            .build(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        contentDescription = null,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        modifier = modifier</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    ) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        val state = painter.state</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        when (state) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            is AsyncImagePainter.State.Loading -> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                Box(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                    modifier = Modifier</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                        .fillMaxSize()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                        .shimmerEffect(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                    contentAlignment = Alignment.Center</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                ) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                    CircularProgressIndicator(modifier = Modifier.size(24.dp))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            is AsyncImagePainter.State.Error -> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                Box(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                    modifier = Modifier</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                        .fillMaxSize()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                        .background(MaterialTheme.colorScheme.errorContainer),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                    contentAlignment = Alignment.Center</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                ) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                    Icon(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                        Icons.Default.BrokenImage,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                        contentDescription = \"加载失败\",</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                        tint = MaterialTheme.colorScheme.onErrorContainer</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                    )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            else -> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                SubcomposeAsyncImageContent()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>@Composable</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fun SimpleImageWithPlaceholder(imageUrl: String, modifier: Modifier = Modifier) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    AsyncImage(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        model = ImageRequest.Builder(LocalContext.current)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            .data(imageUrl)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            .crossfade(true)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            .placeholder(R.drawable.placeholder)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            .error(R.drawable.error_image)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            .fallback(R.drawable.default_avatar)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            .build(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        contentDescription = null,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        modifier = modifier</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"stateDiagram-v2\" data-source=\"stateDiagram-v2&#10;    [*] --&gt; Loading : 开始加载&#10;    Loading --&gt; Success : 加载成功&#10;    Loading --&gt; Error : 加载失败&#10;    Success --&gt; [*]&#10;    Error --&gt; Loading : 重试&#10;    Error --&gt; [*]&#10;&#10;    Loading : 显示 placeholder / shimmer&#10;    Success : 显示图片 + crossfade 动画&#10;    Error : 显示 error drawable\">stateDiagram-v2\n    [*] --&gt; Loading : 开始加载\n    Loading --&gt; Success : 加载成功\n    Loading --&gt; Error : 加载失败\n    Success --&gt; [*]\n    Error --&gt; Loading : 重试\n    Error --&gt; [*]\n\n    Loading : 显示 placeholder / shimmer\n    Success : 显示图片 + crossfade 动画\n    Error : 显示 error drawable</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>属性</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n<th>时机</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>placeholder</code></td>\n<td>加载中占位图</td>\n<td>图片正在下载</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>error</code></td>\n<td>错误占位图</td>\n<td>加载失败</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>fallback</code></td>\n<td>回退占位图</td>\n<td>data 为 null</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>crossfade</code></td>\n<td>淡入过渡动画</td>\n<td>加载完成时</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"磁盘-内存缓存\">磁盘/内存缓存</h2><p>Coil 提供两级缓存：内存缓存和磁盘缓存。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"@Module&#10;@InstallIn(SingletonComponent::class)&#10;object ImageModule {&#10;&#10;    @Provides&#10;    @Singleton&#10;    fun provideImageLoader(@ApplicationContext context: Context): ImageLoader {&#10;        return ImageLoader.Builder(context)&#10;            .memoryCache {&#10;                MemoryCache.Builder(context)&#10;                    .maxSizePercent(0.25)&#10;                    .build()&#10;            }&#10;            .diskCache {&#10;                DiskCache.Builder()&#10;                    .directory(context.cacheDir.resolve(&quot;image_cache&quot;))&#10;                    .maxSizePercent(0.05)&#10;                    .build()&#10;            }&#10;            .crossfade(true)&#10;            .respectCacheHeaders(true)&#10;            .logger(if (BuildConfig.DEBUG) DebugLogger() else null)&#10;            .build()&#10;    }&#10;}&#10;&#10;@Composable&#10;fun CachedImage(imageUrl: String, cachePolicy: CachePolicy = CachePolicy.ENABLED) {&#10;    AsyncImage(&#10;        model = ImageRequest.Builder(LocalContext.current)&#10;            .data(imageUrl)&#10;            .memoryCachePolicy(cachePolicy)&#10;            .diskCachePolicy(cachePolicy)&#10;            .memoryCacheKey(imageUrl)&#10;            .diskCacheKey(imageUrl)&#10;            .build(),&#10;        contentDescription = null&#10;    )&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>@Module</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>@InstallIn(SingletonComponent::class)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>object ImageModule {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    @Provides</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    @Singleton</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fun provideImageLoader(@ApplicationContext context: Context): ImageLoader {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        return ImageLoader.Builder(context)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            .memoryCache {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                MemoryCache.Builder(context)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                    .maxSizePercent(0.25)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                    .build()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            .diskCache {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                DiskCache.Builder()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                    .directory(context.cacheDir.resolve(\"image_cache\"))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                    .maxSizePercent(0.05)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                    .build()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            .crossfade(true)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            .respectCacheHeaders(true)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            .logger(if (BuildConfig.DEBUG) DebugLogger() else null)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            .build()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>@Composable</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fun CachedImage(imageUrl: String, cachePolicy: CachePolicy = CachePolicy.ENABLED) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    AsyncImage(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        model = ImageRequest.Builder(LocalContext.current)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            .data(imageUrl)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            .memoryCachePolicy(cachePolicy)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            .diskCachePolicy(cachePolicy)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            .memoryCacheKey(imageUrl)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            .diskCacheKey(imageUrl)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            .build(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        contentDescription = null</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[ImageRequest] --&gt; B{内存缓存命中?}&#10;    B --&gt;|是| C[直接显示]&#10;    B --&gt;|否| D{磁盘缓存命中?}&#10;    D --&gt;|是| E[解码后显示]&#10;    D --&gt;|否| F[网络下载]&#10;    F --&gt; G[写入磁盘缓存]&#10;    G --&gt; H[解码]&#10;    E --&gt; H&#10;    H --&gt; I[写入内存缓存]&#10;    I --&gt; C&#10;&#10;    classDef cacheStyle stroke:#333,stroke-width:2px&#10;    class B,D cacheStyle\">graph TD\n    A[ImageRequest] --&gt; B{内存缓存命中?}\n    B --&gt;|是| C[直接显示]\n    B --&gt;|否| D{磁盘缓存命中?}\n    D --&gt;|是| E[解码后显示]\n    D --&gt;|否| F[网络下载]\n    F --&gt; G[写入磁盘缓存]\n    G --&gt; H[解码]\n    E --&gt; H\n    H --&gt; I[写入内存缓存]\n    I --&gt; C\n\n    classDef cacheStyle stroke:#333,stroke-width:2px\n    class B,D cacheStyle</pre><p>缓存策略选项：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>CachePolicy</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>ENABLED</code></td>\n<td>读写缓存（默认）</td>\n<td>大多数场景</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>READ_ONLY</code></td>\n<td>只读缓存</td>\n<td>强制刷新但保留缓存</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>WRITE_ONLY</code></td>\n<td>只写缓存</td>\n<td>跳过缓存读取</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>DISABLED</code></td>\n<td>禁用缓存</td>\n<td>每次都从网络加载</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"图片变换\">图片变换</h2><p>Coil 支持多种图片变换，可以在加载时应用。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"@Composable&#10;fun TransformedImages() {&#10;    Column(verticalArrangement = Arrangement.spacedBy(8.dp)) {&#10;        AsyncImage(&#10;            model = ImageRequest.Builder(LocalContext.current)&#10;                .data(&quot;https://example.com/photo.jpg&quot;)&#10;                .transformations(CircleCropTransformation())&#10;                .build(),&#10;            contentDescription = &quot;圆形裁剪&quot;&#10;        )&#10;&#10;        AsyncImage(&#10;            model = ImageRequest.Builder(LocalContext.current)&#10;                .data(&quot;https://example.com/photo.jpg&quot;)&#10;                .transformations(RoundedCornersTransformation(16f))&#10;                .build(),&#10;            contentDescription = &quot;圆角&quot;&#10;        )&#10;&#10;        AsyncImage(&#10;            model = ImageRequest.Builder(LocalContext.current)&#10;                .data(&quot;https://example.com/photo.jpg&quot;)&#10;                .transformations(BlurTransformation(LocalContext.current, 10f, 2f))&#10;                .build(),&#10;            contentDescription = &quot;模糊&quot;&#10;        )&#10;&#10;        AsyncImage(&#10;            model = ImageRequest.Builder(LocalContext.current)&#10;                .data(&quot;https://example.com/photo.jpg&quot;)&#10;                .transformations(GrayscaleTransformation())&#10;                .build(),&#10;            contentDescription = &quot;灰度&quot;&#10;        )&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>@Composable</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fun TransformedImages() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    Column(verticalArrangement = Arrangement.spacedBy(8.dp)) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        AsyncImage(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            model = ImageRequest.Builder(LocalContext.current)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                .data(\"https://example.com/photo.jpg\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                .transformations(CircleCropTransformation())</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                .build(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            contentDescription = \"圆形裁剪\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        AsyncImage(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            model = ImageRequest.Builder(LocalContext.current)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                .data(\"https://example.com/photo.jpg\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                .transformations(RoundedCornersTransformation(16f))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                .build(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            contentDescription = \"圆角\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        AsyncImage(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            model = ImageRequest.Builder(LocalContext.current)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                .data(\"https://example.com/photo.jpg\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                .transformations(BlurTransformation(LocalContext.current, 10f, 2f))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                .build(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            contentDescription = \"模糊\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        AsyncImage(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            model = ImageRequest.Builder(LocalContext.current)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                .data(\"https://example.com/photo.jpg\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                .transformations(GrayscaleTransformation())</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                .build(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            contentDescription = \"灰度\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>变换</th>\n<th>类</th>\n<th>效果</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>圆形裁剪</td>\n<td><code>CircleCropTransformation</code></td>\n<td>将图片裁剪为圆形</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>圆角</td>\n<td><code>RoundedCornersTransformation</code></td>\n<td>添加圆角</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>模糊</td>\n<td><code>BlurTransformation</code></td>\n<td>高斯模糊</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>灰度</td>\n<td><code>GrayscaleTransformation</code></td>\n<td>黑白滤镜</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>也可以实现自定义变换：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"class WatermarkTransformation(&#10;    private val watermarkText: String&#10;) : Transformation {&#10;&#10;    override val cacheKey: String = &quot;watermark_$watermarkText&quot;&#10;&#10;    override suspend fun transform(input: Bitmap, size: Size): Bitmap {&#10;        val output = input.copy(input.config, true)&#10;        val canvas = Canvas(output)&#10;        val paint = Paint().apply {&#10;            color = Color.WHITE&#10;            alpha = 128&#10;            textSize = 48f&#10;            isAntiAlias = true&#10;        }&#10;        canvas.drawText(watermarkText, 20f, output.height - 20f, paint)&#10;        return output&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>class WatermarkTransformation(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private val watermarkText: String</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>) : Transformation {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    override val cacheKey: String = \"watermark_$watermarkText\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    override suspend fun transform(input: Bitmap, size: Size): Bitmap {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        val output = input.copy(input.config, true)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        val canvas = Canvas(output)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        val paint = Paint().apply {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            color = Color.WHITE</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            alpha = 128</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            textSize = 48f</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            isAntiAlias = true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        canvas.drawText(watermarkText, 20f, output.height - 20f, paint)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        return output</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> 在 Compose 中使用 <code>Modifier.clip(CircleShape)</code> 配合 <code>ContentScale.Crop</code> 通常比 <code>CircleCropTransformation</code> 更高效，因为避免了额外的 Bitmap 操作。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>Coil 是 Compose-first 的图片加载库，<code>AsyncImage</code> 是最常用的加载组件</li>\n<li><code>SubcomposeAsyncImage</code> 支持自定义加载状态、错误状态的 Composable</li>\n<li>两级缓存（内存 + 磁盘）自动管理，通过 <code>CachePolicy</code> 控制缓存行为</li>\n<li>内置 <code>CircleCrop</code>、<code>RoundedCorners</code>、<code>Blur</code>、<code>Grayscale</code> 等变换</li>\n<li>自定义 <code>ImageLoader</code> 通过 Hilt 注入，统一配置缓存大小和默认行为</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"图片加载","id":"图片加载"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"Coil 基础（Compose-first）","id":"coil-基础-compose-first"},{"level":2,"text":"Placeholder / Error / Crossfade","id":"placeholder-error-crossfade"},{"level":2,"text":"磁盘/内存缓存","id":"磁盘-内存缓存"},{"level":2,"text":"图片变换","id":"图片变换"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"Flow 与 LiveData","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/android-development/networking-and-data/flow-and-livedata"},"next":{"title":"Gradle 基础","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/android-development/build-and-release/gradle-fundamentals"}}